{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1295036-hermetic-magic-for-storypath","id":1295036,"title":"Hermetic Magic for Storypath","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-03-08T06:31:26-08:00","id":1295036,"title":"Hermetic Magic for Storypath","content":"Hello guys,<br /> <br /> It\u2019s not an TC post properly, but it uses the basis on TC Storypath system (as Scion have no skill tricks or edges).<br /> <br /> Anyway, as I told before, I love Ars Magica, but hate how slow the game goes... I tried to make it to D20, but the way to do that was too far disturbing to get any good result... Now with some rule ideas brought from Mages (Ascension and Awaken) and the awesome way complex actions work on Storypath, I put together some rules for Hermetic Magic on a more action and character focused game...<br /> <br /> It\u2019s far incomplete to be used alone, you need the TC core to get most of the rules and need the Ars Magica (I use 5th edition, but probably all work) to get the magical concepts (kinds of magic, arcane connection multiplier, things like that) and setting concepts (what is Hermetic, what is the order, what are the houses, etc).<br /> <br /> It\u2019s on my Dropbox, and I start apologising for my English as it is not my mother language. Corrections are welcome and suggestions for rules and missing info too.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/p3hwaem623crdnv/Hermetic%20Magic.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/p3hwaem623crdnv/Hermetic%20Magic.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/p3hwaem623crdnv/Hermetic%20Magic.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.dropbox.com/s/p3hwaem623crdnv/Hermetic%20Magic.pdf?dl=0 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-08T11:09:05-08:00","id":1295085,"title":"","content":"Have you posted this on the ars magica forum? I'd throw it up on the ars magica reddit: reddit.com/r/arsmagica <a href=\"http://forum.atlas-games.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.atlas-games.com/ </a><br /> <br /> I have Ars Magica but not the Storypath system. This needs some more explanation to have wider appeal and get people to have a sense of how it will work out in play. I think you have some good ideas though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2783-tytalus","name":"Tytalus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2783_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"491"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-08T12:57:40-08:00","id":1295113,"title":"","content":"Thanks!<br /> <br /> As the first book using Storypath is going to be available only next month, I don\u2019t know how far I can go from this forum without needing to explain the entire system and how it works. I mean, it\u2019s not a complex system, but it\u2019s not open to public, only to backers, so there may be some changes on the system until launch. Maybe later I bring it to AM forums.<br /> <br /> So far I am trying to test how the casting is working, I want to keep Magic a challenge but possible, it\u2019s more about refine the idea and put the numbers to work. I know the rituals are not difficult, but requires time to set things up, more or less what we see in AM, but I am not sure about the formulaic and spontaneous spells.<br /> <br /> Also I am trying to let the hedge wizards to be interesting characters, not as versatile as an Magus, but I still with some power on face to face situations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-08T15:08:37-08:00","id":1295135,"title":"","content":"There is the free <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/187949/Storypath-System-Preview\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product...System-Preview</a><br /> <br /> So the base resolution stuff was previously disseminated. There was also an actual play podcast that played some Scion 2e, but I haven't listened yet, so I couldn't tell you how much of an idea it gives to how the system works.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-20T07:00:03-07:00","id":1298132,"title":"","content":"I updated the file after a few tests I did, most of them related to the casting. I would be happy if you all take a look.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/p3hwaem623crdnv/Hermetic%20Magic.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=