find it weird that a being who is basically attuned to magic is incapable of safely using magic, so nope, not gonna touch it beyond the idea of warping from intense and dangerous magical failures) (Of course this is not a you thing, more a Ars Magica thing.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-27T21:35:35-07:00","id":1321321,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1295036-hermetic-magic-for-storypath?p=1321320#post1321320\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The one thing I can note is that I will be ignoring Warping, which is a system I detest even in Ars Magica and so I won't be using it here. (I find it weird that a being who is basically attuned to magic is incapable of safely using magic, so nope, not gonna touch it beyond the idea of warping from intense and dangerous magical failures) (Of course this is not a you thing, more a Ars Magica thing.)</div> </div> </div> </div>I laugh a little with this, because I was about to not add it to the file just because it\u2019s confuse and I hate the original too... in the end I made a easy version of it and it\u2019s not much similar to the entire idea of Warping.<br /> <br /> But you have my total bless for not giving a ... about the entire Warping parts...<br /> <br /> I do like the idea of Warping as transforming the Magus into a witch, not because of failing magic but because of over using it... but it\u2019s not the point here...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-28T14:35:59-07:00","id":1327966,"title":"","content":"While the Forms and Techniques of Ars Magica are really nifty I can't help but think up other potential sets that could exist. My current set up is this. <br /> <br /> Technique: Alter, Control, Create, Destroy, Mend, Move, Protect, Know<br /> Forms: Air, Earth, Fire, Water, Plant, Animal, Machine, Body, Mind, Spirit, Illusion, Time, Space, Fate, Arcane, Void. <br /> <br /> As a note Arcane represents pure magical energy while Void represents that which is from elsewhere. Which is different from Space as that is location and movement and distance. <br /> <br /> Not that I would expect any modification to what you wrote but I figured my random thought intersects as an idea with the nature of this thread. <br /> <br /> It also makes me really wish for an updated, modern, or new version of the Ars Magica system, though enhanced a bit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-28T14:45:42-07:00","id":1327969,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1295036-hermetic-magic-for-storypath?p=1327966#post1327966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While the Forms and Techniques of Ars Magica are really nifty I can't help but think up other potential sets that could exist. My current set up is this. <br /> <br /> Technique: Alter, Control, Create, Destroy, Mend, Move, Protect, Know<br /> Forms: Air, Earth, Fire, Water, Plant, Animal, Machine, Body, Mind, Spirit, Illusion, Time, Space, Fate, Arcane, Void. <br /> <br /> As a note Arcane represents pure magical energy while Void represents that which is from elsewhere. Which is different from Space as that is location and movement and distance. <br /> <br /> Not that I would expect any modification to what you wrote but I figured my random thought intersects as an idea with the nature of this thread. <br /> <br /> It also makes me really wish for an updated, modern, or new version of the Ars Magica system, though enhanced a bit.</div> </div> </div> </div>You know I was thinking about it this afternoom. I want to make a magic system for Scion to put on the Nexus, and, as I used Ars Magica idea, I can\u2019t use this file the way it is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-28T15:25:05-07:00","id":1327975,"title":"","content":"There is so much potential in a power system like this. I mean you can do nearly anything with the proper application of forms and techniques. Especially if you use a list that is a little more comprehensive you can basically have a magic system that can touch everything. hehe<br /> <br /> I do like the idea of a mystic group who managed to invent and codify such magic. Its really brilliant to me. <br /> <br /> (This all said, the funny thing is that Mage is basically a variant on the Ars Magica system. In fact one version of Ars Magica was owned by White Wolf and such.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}